Port this Kora 1.x component to 2.0. It threads the Kora Context through its lifecycle so downstream calls see the request metadata:

@Root @Component
public final class AuditStarter implements Lifecycle {
    private final Context context;
    public AuditStarter(Context context) { this.context = context; }
    @Override public void init() { Context.current().set(AUDIT_KEY, "startup"); }
    @Override public void release() {}
}
